draw(arc((0,0),3,0,90),red,Arrow(6));

dot((0,3), red);
label("$(0,3)$", (0,3), W);
dot((3,0), red);
[/asy]

Therefore, the polar coordinates are $\boxed{\left( 3, \frac{\pi}{2} \right)}.$

